linuxmuster-squid (1.2.0) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * --internet-group accepts one group per school (repeat the flag): the proxy
    requires the role group and membership in any of the listed internet groups,
    so the Internetsperre is enforced at any location and follows a visitor
    across schools. Single-group usage is unchanged.

