linuxmuster-squid (1.1.0) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * Honor the linuxmuster Internetsperre: optional --internet-group per instance,
    re-checked live on a short TTL (grace=0), so removing a user from the group
    blocks new requests within ~30s. Omitted means role group only.

